    out property <string> volume: "M 4 9.5 H 8 L 13 5.5 V 18.5 L 8 14.5 H 4 Z M 16.5 9 C 18 10.5 18 13.5 16.5 15 M 19 6.5 C 21.5 9.2 21.5 14.8 19 17.5";
